# Authentication

The application supports two roles.

## Admin

Permissions

- Add Student
- Update Student
- Delete Student
- Create Course
- Update Course
- Delete Course
- View All Students

## Student

Permissions

- View own profile
- View enrolled course

---

# Database Schema

## Courses

| Column | Type |
|----------|----------|
| course_id | Primary Key |
| course_name | VARCHAR |
| course_code | UNIQUE VARCHAR |
| course_duration | INTEGER |

## Students

| Column | Type |
|----------|----------|
| student_id | Primary Key |
| name | VARCHAR |
| email | UNIQUE VARCHAR |
| password | VARCHAR |
| course_id | Foreign Key |

